// CACHE: GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/commits | owner=CodeEditorLand | repo=Land | per_page=5 | page=10 → GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/commits.RESPONSE.map(Author,Date,File,Message,SHA)
{
	"Set": [
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-07T16:38:16Z",
			"File": [
				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				151,
				12
			],
			"Message": "Refactor documentation to replace em quad characters with HTML entities for better visibility and consistency across multiple files. Update Markdown rendering logic to preserve em quad characters during text processing. Introduce new scripts for managing repository transfers between organizations, including functionality for listing forks and transferring documentation repositories. Enhance README with updated links and formatting.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "b9306309eec99ddea2a5e0ffa7337cef80cec54c"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-05T10:36:51Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				146,
				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Dependency and Element submodules to latest upstream revisions\n\nUpdate the Dependency submodule to advance Tauri's PluginsWorkspace and TauriSearch submodules. PluginsWorkspace reformats HTML permission reference tables across dialog, fs, log, and shell plugins from expanded multi-line format to consistent flat tab-indented structure. TauriSearch fixes malformed markup in seven pattern guide test fixtures (bridge.md, cloudbridge.md, cloudish.md, glui.md, hermit.md, lockdown.md, multiwin.md) by adding missing closing </rater> tags.\n\nUpdate the Element submodule across Cocoon, Mountain, SideCar, and Wind. Cocoon performs routine regeneration updating RouteManifest timestamp and rebuilding all compiled artifacts across bootstrap, effect, service, handler, gRPC, and dual-track layers. Mountain completes parking_lot migration for ApplicationState and command modules, replacing std::sync::Mutex and tokio::sync::RwLock with parking_lot equivalents across 20+ state modules (Debug, Decorations, Diagnostics, Documents, Keybindings, LifecyclePhase, Markers, NavigationHistory, OutputChannels, TreeViews, Webviews, WorkingCopy), removing poison-error boilerplate and simplifying lock acquisition. SideCar adds missing trailing newlines to Cache.json for POSIX text file compliance. Wind applies automated formatting to generated Effect-TS service interfaces and ESBuild configs, regenerates 200+ service interfaces from VS Code upstream sources, and updates CommandCatalog with 6,600+ new command entries (ServiceCatalog version 2026-06-05).\n\nAll changes maintain API compatibility with no breaking changes. Keeps the Land editor's dependency tree aligned with upstream improvements.",
			"SHA": "3753faa522a89033b25e18a91f4a76b46dec2400"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-05T08:41:02Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				146,
				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Dependency and Element submodules to latest upstream revisions\n\nUpdate the Dependency submodule to Tauri upstream commit abc01a85, incorporating permission table reformatting across dialog, fs, log, and shell plugins from flat tab-indented format to expanded multi-line structure with blank line separation. Also fixes seven TauriSearch pattern guide test fixtures (bridge.md, cloudbridge.md, cloudish.md, glui.md, hermit.md, lockdown.md, multiwin.md) by removing duplicate `</rater>` closing tags that created invalid nested markup.\n\nUpdate the Element submodule across all internal components (Mountain, Cocoon, Wind, Sky, Output, Common, Echo, Rest, Worker, Air, Grove, Maintain, SideCar, Vine) to synchronize with latest upstream revisions.\n\nKeeps the Land editor's dependency tree aligned with upstream formatting improvements and bug fixes without altering semantic content in the application layer.",
			"SHA": "8c2e765245e70790994e2acb168efd7162e8fe4a"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-05T07:41:42Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				146,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule to latest upstream revisions\n\nUpdate the Element submodule across all internal components (Mountain, Cocoon, Wind, Sky, Output, Common, Echo, Rest, Worker, Air, Grove, Maintain, SideCar, Vine) to synchronize with upstream.\n\nMountain consolidates FileReadAlias into FileSystem with Matches updates, removes Clone derives from application state in favor of SharedApplicationState, adds SCMHandleCounter for source-control provider handle management, enhances ExtensionRegistry provider handle and command registry access, and resolves issues 64, 65, 67, 68. Cocoon updates @effect/platform-node to 0.107.0, protobufjs to 8.6.0, Vitest to 4.1.8, normalizes ESBuild configs, and regenerates RouteManifest with three new FileWatcher RPC methods (Unwatch, Watch, WatchStatus) increasing method count from 142 to 145. Wind applies automated formatting across 200+ Effect-TS service interfaces and ESBuild configs. Sky upgrades Astro to 6.4.4 and Vite to 8.0.16. Output expands architectural comments documenting Electron→Tauri+Effect-TS transformation rationale. Common and Echo update @cloudflare/workers-types to 4.20260605.1; Echo also bumps miniflare to 4.20260603.0 and wrangler to 4.98.0. Remaining submodules receive mechanical formatting improvements.\n\nAll changes maintain API compatibility with no breaking changes.",
			"SHA": "47083961939c4f2b95943554e4d2d022b6dc69c9"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-05T07:40:04Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
